<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Grokati is an automated / AI-assisted news project focused exclusively on Grok and xAI updates. Accuracy and signal over volume."
>
  <section class="about-content">
    <h1 class="page-title">About Grokati</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle muted">Accuracy first. Signal over volume.</p>

    <p>
      Grokati is a focused news site dedicated to <strong>Grok</strong> and <strong>xAI</strong>.
      There is currently no single high-quality outlet that consistently covers official Grok and xAI
      developments with clear sourcing and minimal noise. This project aims to fill that gap.
    </p>

    <h2>What this site is</h2>
    <p>
      Grokati is an <strong>automated and AI-assisted</strong> project. A monitoring pipeline watches
      official accounts and high-signal announcements, then uses AI to draft short posts and
      Markdown articles. Every article must attribute its original source. No details are invented.
    </p>

    <h2>Core principles</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Accuracy over volume</strong> — prefer silence to low-value or speculative content.</li>
      <li><strong>Clear attribution</strong> — every claim points back to an official or primary source.</li>
      <li><strong>No hype, no invention</strong> — neutral, precise language.</li>
      <li><strong>File-based and simple</strong> — Markdown content, static site, easy to host and audit.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Independence</h2>
    <p>
      Grokati is an independent project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or operated by xAI,
      X Corp, or Elon Musk. Coverage is limited to publicly available official statements and
      high-signal primary sources.
    </p>

    <h2>Who operates Grokati</h2>
    <p>
      Grokati is a trading name of <strong>XenMedia Marketing Limited</strong>, a company registered
      in England.
    </p>
